Description: Implements Generalized Canonical Correlation Analysis (GCCA)
    with missing individuals (whole missing rows; van de Velden and
    Bijmolt, 2006) for multi-block omics integration. The package operates
    directly on HDF5 matrices via
    the BigDataStatMeth C++ API to scale computations; R functions are thin
    wrappers around the C++ core.
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0),
    BigDataStatMeth (>= 2.0.3)
